Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.90,0:04:50.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《大雄与翼之勇者》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.15,0:02:24.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来为您播报世界头条消息
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.12,0:02:26.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非洲在持续干旱的情况下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.32,0:02:28.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为寻觅水源
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.62,0:02:32.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生成群的火鹳鸟 在一夕之间消失的怪现象
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.20,0:02:36.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为油轮漏出的原油 而让苦无居所的海鸟群
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.10,0:02:39.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也在不知不觉中全都消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.63,0:02:42.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔…这真的很诡异耶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.17,0:02:42.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.37,0:02:44.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.87,0:02:47.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又要说 它们是被外星人带走的对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.04,0:02:48.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.08,0:02:51.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一种像鸟的外星人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.65,0:02:53.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄的想法太幼稚了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.05,0:02:56.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外星人是长得像鱆鱼耶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.62,0:02:59.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得 大雄说得也很有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.69,0:03:03.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从这次的共同研究我查到了…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.69,0:03:07.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界上有很多关于鸟人的传说喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.56,0:03:08.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟人？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.30,0:03:11.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外型像鸟的人类 叫做鸟人没错吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.90,0:03:13.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 一定是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.00,0:03:14.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如说…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.07,0:03:17.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个古亚述时代的精灵图像…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.54,0:03:21.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然身体是人的样子 可是却有老鹰的头跟翅膀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.34,0:03:27.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有 埃及神荷鲁斯 它的脸是老鹰身体却是人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.08,0:03:30.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日本也有喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.39,0:03:31.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.59,0:03:32.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.22,0:03:34.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乌鸦天狗很明显的就是鸟人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.06,0:03:37.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么这些全都是外星人喽？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.69,0:03:39.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实话也不能说得这么肯定啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.86,0:03:41.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是说不定真的有喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.83,0:03:43.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快把这些做完吧… 鸟人…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.77,0:03:52.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.14,0:04:28.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.16,0:05:48.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.29,0:05:51.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要像鸟一样？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.23,0:05:53.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自由的在天空飞翔？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.23,0:05:55.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竹蜻蜓拿去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.53,0:05:56.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.23,0:05:57.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说鸟人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.60,0:05:58.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.47,0:06:00.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超人？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.67,0:06:02.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超人不就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.49,0:06:28.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超人 我是哆啦哆啦超人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.76,0:06:30.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超人？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.83,0:06:31.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.93,0:06:33.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是像鸟的人啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.77,0:06:34.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像鸟的人？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.14,0:06:38.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说我不想靠引擎或马达
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.27,0:06:41.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要靠自己的力量在天空飞翔啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.21,0:06:42.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.58,0:06:47.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一天终于让我等到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.15,0:06:50.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次妈妈要你做事 你就说“快拿出法宝来”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.45,0:06:53.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫你做功课 你也说“快拿出法宝来”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.72,0:06:56.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次只想轻松不肯吃苦的大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.16,0:07:00.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总算愿意靠自己的力量…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.53,0:07:03.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就不知道 我期盼这一天期盼多久了…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.87,0:07:06.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也知道 我不能一直这样下去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.67,0:07:07.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太有骨气了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.30,0:07:08.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.47,0:07:09.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.97,0:07:13.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以让我靠自己飞起来的法宝 快拿出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.74,0:07:14.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天哪…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.18,0:07:18.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 这要靠你自己动手做才对呀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.38,0:07:19.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.62,0:07:22.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看 就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.68,0:07:23.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.82,0:07:27.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看 我就是想做像这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.12,0:07:29.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 这个是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.06,0:07:31.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这么决定
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.33,0:07:32.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先找材料…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.63,0:07:36.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种东西怎么可能飞得起来嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.33,0:07:39.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是先别浇他冷水…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.53,0:08:09.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.93,0:08:11.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做得很好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.30,0:08:14.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们到山上试飞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.30,0:08:16.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.11,0:08:20.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的做得很用心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.51,0:08:23.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…你听我说…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.75,0:08:25.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 我要飞了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.82,0:08:33.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我飞起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.52,0:08:38.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好下面先铺好气垫
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.13,0:08:44.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可不要多管闲事喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.03,0:08:46.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是好心没好报
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.90,0:08:48.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该飞得起来…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.64,0:08:52.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 人类的力量根本就…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.54,0:08:53.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次我一定要飞起来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.91,0:08:55.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别试了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.93,0:09:12.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.80,0:09:18.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看他这么认真 我实在无法阻止他啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.57,0:09:23.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要用气垫啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.67,0:09:24.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.44,0:09:26.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摆了气垫我反而容易松懈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.94,0:09:28.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.08,0:09:37.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇…飞起来了飞起来了 根本没有飞起来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.95,0:09:40.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类的力量根本就是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.96,0:09:43.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好想靠自己的力量飞起来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.69,0:09:45.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 我要对你另眼看待了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.33,0:09:48.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唔 那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.46,0:09:51.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.97,0:09:52.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.83,0:09:54.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的小哔飞走了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.47,0:09:56.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它有没有飞到这边来？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.34,0:09:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.47,0:09:58.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.98,0:10:01.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快回来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.13,0:10:20.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 你在干么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.73,0:10:21.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.36,0:10:22.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看那边
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.37,0:10:29.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 我们快过去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.51,0:10:32.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得是这个方向啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.37,0:10:33.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的太突然了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.04,0:10:35.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他刚才还闪过小哔呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.51,0:10:38.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.92,0:10:41.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.76,0:10:50.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…鸟吗？ 还是人啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.53,0:10:51.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.93,0:10:54.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这真的是鸟的羽毛耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.66,0:10:56.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说…是鸟人？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.43,0:10:57.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.67,0:11:02.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他怎么会开着这种飞机 突然从天空冒出来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.40,0:11:03.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这到底是什么人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.17,0:11:06.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他好像受伤了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.67,0:11:08.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们想办法帮帮他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.44,0:11:11.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是被人发现的话 一定会引起一阵骚动的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.18,0:11:13.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隐形喷雾剂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.68,0:11:17.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么一来 就可以把飞机藏起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.29,0:11:20.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你过来背他
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.56,0:11:22.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我来背啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.19,0:11:23.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.06,0:11:24.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们先带他回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.93,0:11:29.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞不好这会是个大事件喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.30,0:11:31.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么找不到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.07,0:11:33.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.07,0:11:36.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来是这个方向没错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.31,0:11:38.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.94,0:11:40.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这件事绝对不能告诉任何人喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.98,0:11:42.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然啰
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.10,0:12:03.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他好像醒过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.97,0:12:08.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人…类…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.34,0:12:10.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.61,0:12:11.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上面在吵什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.51,0:12:14.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,羽毛？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.98,0:12:15.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该不会…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.84,0:12:18.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又开始偷偷的养什么东西…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.75,0:12:22.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要怕 我们不会对你怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.48,0:12:24.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的…雪鹅号…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.49,0:12:28.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们弄去哪里了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.86,0:12:30.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪…鹅…号？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.63,0:12:32.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说的是那架飞机吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.86,0:12:35.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们把它藏在 你刚才摔下来的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.76,0:12:37.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你放心 不会被发现的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.37,0:12:39.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你们…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.67,0:12:43.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们快带我去 雪鹅号藏匿的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.50,0:12:44.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.37,0:12:47.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 糟糕 妈妈上来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.88,0:12:55.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.02,0:12:58.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦 哆啦A梦你怎么啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.29,0:13:01.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我…好像有点发烧…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.69,0:13:03.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又好像没有…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.66,0:13:07.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又在玩花样了 我拿很苦的药给你吃
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.53,0:13:11.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你在那里干什么呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.30,0:13:14.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这…里头什么东西也没有啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.67,0:13:16.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你就给我让开
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.17,0:13:17.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要检查
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.82,0:13:30.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他应该是跑去 藏飞机的那座山里了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.69,0:13:32.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁他还没被发现的时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.92,0:13:34.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.56,0:13:38.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想去哪里啊 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.09,0:13:39.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然你真的想养鸡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.19,0:13:43.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好啊 妈妈绝对不会答应
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.84,0:13:50.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唉 好个独家消息就这么飞了…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.57,0:13:51.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天都黑了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.71,0:13:52.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们明天再来找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.44,0:13:55.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是有什么东西掉下来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.84,0:13:58.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 这件事也不能让大雄知道喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.85,0:13:59.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.09,0:14:08.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底藏到哪里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.09,0:14:14.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得是在这附近呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.14,0:14:27.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个声音…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.38,0:14:28.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.24,0:14:29.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.13,0:14:46.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.50,0:14:49.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你明明有翅膀却飞不起来啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.40,0:14:56.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们人类为什么会飞啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.00,0:14:59.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去漆喷雾剂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.14,0:15:02.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 它在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.64,0:15:04.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 雪鹅号
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.78,0:15:06.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊…都摔坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.55,0:15:11.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来要把这个修理好的话 可能要花一些时间了…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.65,0:15:13.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一起来帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.15,0:15:15.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系 我自己来就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.66,0:15:18.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到现在还不相信我们啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.17,0:15:26.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢均KA大雄…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.44,0:15:30.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的名字叫古斯基啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.94,0:15:32.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是从哪里来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.94,0:15:34.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该不是从宇宙来的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.94,0:15:38.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是哪里呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.45,0:15:42.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这…我不能说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.55,0:15:47.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看在飞机还没修好之前
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.19,0:15:49.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就暂时先躲在这里好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.32,0:15:52.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟箱型露营胶囊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.19,0:15:54.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么这么小啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.83,0:15:55.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看着好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.23,0:16:03.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里的话视野应该也不错 就这里好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.84,0:16:06.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再设置个随意电梯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.34,0:16:10.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本电梯前往鸟箱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.25,0:16:20.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来里面这么宽敞啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.35,0:16:23.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实里面并不大啦 是我们变小了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.59,0:16:27.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 这里的视野好棒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.60,0:16:28.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.86,0:16:31.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们为什么会有 这么不可思议的力量呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.73,0:16:34.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实真正厉害的 只有哆啦A梦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.87,0:16:37.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿…这也没什么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.51,0:16:47.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小哔…飞到哪里去了…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.15,0:16:51.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望它平安无事…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.52,0:16:55.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 你就好好的休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.52,0:16:57.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们明天再来找你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.43,0:16:59.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.77,0:17:12.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是大家知道我在人类的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.11,0:17:15.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定会很惊讶吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.28,0:17:20.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的没想到 我会受到人类的帮助…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.76,0:17:38.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还真有这回事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.10,0:17:40.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你每次都这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.90,0:17:47.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,背上有翅膀像鸟的人类… 还说在屋顶上跑呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.81,0:17:51.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一定跟我们 昨天看到的东西有关连
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.88,0:17:56.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许就像太郎说的 是“鸟人外型的外星人”吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.38,0:17:59.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这肯定是个劲爆消息
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.32,0:18:00.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 对了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.62,0:18:02.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道 不行告诉大雄对不对…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.06,0:18:04.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.56,0:18:11.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 开始动手修理啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.33,0:18:13.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨 大家早安
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.43,0:18:15.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早安 昨晚睡得好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.80,0:18:18.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸亏有你们的帮忙 我的精神都恢复了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.67,0:18:20.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天说好今天要来帮你的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.84,0:18:22.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.11,0:18:24.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个机翼坏成这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.61,0:18:26.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看这个用得上吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.31,0:18:28.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我自己做的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.35,0:18:31.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.62,0:18:35.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然看起来快破掉了… 应该可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.66,0:18:37.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.39,0:18:39.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.56,0:18:42.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,固体灯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.40,0:18:44.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用它来补强一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.07,0:18:47.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 那边帮我扶一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.13,0:18:48.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.64,0:18:50.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄他做得好起劲喔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.31,0:18:55.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 再右边一点… 好…可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.88,0:18:57.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你要抓紧喔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.32,0:19:05.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.72,0:19:07.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接着修螺旋桨
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.42,0:19:08.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.82,0:19:09.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要扶好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.19,0:19:12.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了吗 我要试喽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.16,0:19:15.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 去转一下踏板看看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.20,0:19:16.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.37,0:19:20.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 再多转几下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.11,0:19:27.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们两个就像兄弟一样耶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.21,0:19:30.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 大功告成了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.61,0:19:32.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就能飞起来了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.61,0:19:33.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.91,0:19:35.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.72,0:19:37.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太好了 古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.85,0:19:39.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在就来试飞看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.42,0:19:43.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.52,0:19:46.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是谁说有鸟人外星人的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.93,0:19:48.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你自己啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.53,0:19:49.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是我啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.63,0:19:51.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.87,0:19:55.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看 这不是昨天坠机的残骸吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.40,0:19:57.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.44,0:19:59.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该还在这附近才对
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.75,0:20:10.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 加油喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.46,0:20:18.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.03,0:20:20.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊…是外星人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.46,0:20:23.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 别让他逃了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.47,0:20:25.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.47,0:20:32.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.24,0:20:32.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.98,0:20:37.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.24,0:20:38.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快用竹蜻蜓
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.05,0:20:46.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.49,0:20:48.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.26,0:20:49.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.99,0:20:55.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 跟昨天一样的洞穴…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.03,0:20:59.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.77,0:21:00.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.78,0:21:10.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.54,0:21:11.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.31,0:21:13.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜可能是时空隧道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.51,0:21:14.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时空隧道？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.05,0:21:18.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是普通的鸟耶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.29,0:21:23.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里到底通往哪里啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.82,0:21:25.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 这样很危险耶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.56,0:21:27.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,均KA要带我们去哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.83,0:21:29.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.58,0:21:44.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 这是哪里啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.51,0:21:45.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快放我们下去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.85,0:21:48.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.32,0:21:51.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快放我们下去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.56,0:22:01.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.56,0:22:03.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 你看…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.63,0:22:05.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 这些家伙是什么人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.57,0:22:13.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇啊 我们穿过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.36,0:22:34.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这到底是什么地方啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.06,0:22:36.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我的竹蜻蜓…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.03,0:22:38.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电池没了 快下去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.11,0:22:47.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.17,0:22:47.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.45,0:23:03.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就不知道 绿色的全都任你挑呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.59,0:23:07.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.90,0:23:13.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母鸡小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.57,0:23:15.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有你的限时信喔
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.07,0:23:17.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.91,0:23:18.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.21,0:23:22.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 是公鸡先生寄来的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.44,0:23:28.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快一点呀 鹳鸟婆婆 已经快下蛋了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.68,0:23:30.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.85,0:23:32.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快一点啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.22,0:23:37.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘻 鹳鸟是接生婆耶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.46,0:23:40.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塘鹅最适合当邮差先生了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.16,0:23:43.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了 这里就是古斯基居住的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.00,0:23:47.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来真的有鸟人世界耶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.43,0:23:48.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们别乱动
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.10,0:23:52.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们从哪里来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.94,0:23:54.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔 这几个都是人类
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.44,0:23:57.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长 这家伙是只猫耶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.61,0:23:59.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还真的是猫呢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.68,0:24:05.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总算有人认出我是猫来了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.45,0:24:09.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 现在不是感动的时候吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.99,0:24:11.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫是鸟的大敌
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.13,0:24:12.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我抓起来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.53,0:24:19.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要跑
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.24,0:24:22.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要跑到哪里去才好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.17,0:24:23.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.97,0:24:25.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快想想办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.98,0:24:30.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶路的小猫
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.21,0:24:33.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.51,0:24:34.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 快走呀
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.72,0:24:36.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶路的话 要不要搭驼鸟计程车啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.22,0:24:38.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,计程车？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.22,0:24:39.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先坐上去再说了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.25,0:24:41.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请问要去哪里呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.72,0:24:43.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快往前走就对了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.92,0:24:44.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.79,0:24:48.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.73,0:24:51.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,避免被甩出去请抓紧喔
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.17,0:24:54.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太太 您还满意吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.50,0:24:57.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我实在太喜欢这个发型了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.50,0:24:58.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢您的光临
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.74,0:24:59.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请慢走
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.05,0:25:10.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么有这么粗暴的计程车啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.58,0:25:12.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别跑
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.76,0:25:17.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是气死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.83,0:25:24.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 大家排队过马路啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.97,0:25:26.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么停下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.00,0:25:27.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走呀
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.10,0:25:28.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不行走
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.54,0:25:31.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过马路的时候要小心喔
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.81,0:25:36.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊…哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.28,0:25:38.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们追上来了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.55,0:25:40.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就走旁边的小路吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.55,0:25:41.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.05,0:25:45.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们往那边跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.82,0:25:48.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前面的路会越来越窄
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.62,0:25:50.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你们抓紧啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.40,0:25:59.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,头快弯下去
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.08,0:26:09.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.88,0:26:11.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经把警备队甩掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.08,0:26:13.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.79,0:26:20.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你们保重啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.87,0:26:35.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经干了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.90,0:26:37.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来该怎么办哪
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.87,0:26:40.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之先去找胖虎他们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.61,0:26:45.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好壮观的建筑物喔
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.45,0:26:55.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不要太过分喔
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.12,0:26:57.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 有人来了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.46,0:26:58.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快躲到这里面
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.63,0:27:01.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说什么我都不会听的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.20,0:27:08.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要每次 一有人类侵入就找我来
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.17,0:27:10.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.14,0:27:14.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.64,0:27:16.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 主人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.88,0:27:19.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唔…好重啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.88,0:27:21.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真搞不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.18,0:27:24.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真搞不懂滋古连度在想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.18,0:27:54.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我应该不会出门了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.43,0:28:06.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们进去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.43,0:28:09.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许能得到一些情报喔
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.47,0:28:14.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来这里好像是个 考古学家住的地方耶
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.94,0:28:15.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.70,0:28:17.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太郎给我们看过这个东西
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.50,0:28:19.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像荷鲁斯的像喔
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.71,0:28:22.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说的话 很久以前就跟地球有关…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.71,0:28:27.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你们啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.18,0:28:28.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.98,0:28:30.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们怎么会在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.72,0:28:32.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一路追着你结果就…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.49,0:28:35.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这真是稀客啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.99,0:28:38.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类的小孩跟…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.73,0:28:40.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…一只狸啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.76,0:28:43.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.73,0:28:45.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是一只机器猫
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.97,0:28:50.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄跟静香 都是我的救命恩人
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.30,0:28:52.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是我的好朋友猫头鹰博士
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.01,0:28:54.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.91,0:28:55.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.91,0:28:58.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又随便跑到 人类的世界去了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.98,0:28:59.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.05,0:29:01.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 刚才那两个人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.08,0:29:05.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能被乌鸦警备队抓走了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.77,0:29:27.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放我们去啦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.44,0:29:29.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.51,0:29:31.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要把你们揍得扁扁的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.78,0:29:38.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滋古连度长官 就是这两个人
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.02,0:29:41.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是他们的老大吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.29,0:29:43.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快放我们出去
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.82,0:29:47.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么凶暴 的确是人类
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.49,0:29:48.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官 该怎么处置他们？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.30,0:29:52.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然是人类的话那就不必审判
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.03,0:29:54.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立刻处刑
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.04,0:29:56.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,处刑？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.97,0:29:59.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们怎么可以随便决定呢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.11,0:30:00.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随便决定？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.54,0:30:01.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么蠢话
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.78,0:30:03.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你们人类的一意孤行
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.81,0:30:06.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才会造成 无计其数的鸟类受到迫害
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.31,0:30:08.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天就处刑
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.78,0:30:11.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼 可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.12,0:30:11.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别走
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.05,0:30:13.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.32,0:30:16.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟托邦…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.86,0:30:17.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.59,0:30:21.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟托邦是从人类的世界中 被隔绝出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.03,0:30:23.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么是隔绝啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.56,0:30:25.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意思是离很远不能往来
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.83,0:30:27.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里跟你们的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.07,0:30:31.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是由一个叫鸟航道的超空间 连接起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.87,0:30:34.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其中一个 是跟后山连接在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.01,0:30:37.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是为什么我们不知道呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.84,0:30:42.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个入口只有 鸟类跟我们鸟人知道而已
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.52,0:30:45.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且也不会停留在同一个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.59,0:30:47.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才一直没有被人发现
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.09,0:30:48.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.66,0:30:51.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要赶快想办法 救救胖虎跟小夫啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.09,0:30:52.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 对喔
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.93,0:30:53.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.09,0:30:57.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 就这样走出去的话 马上又会被追捕
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.60,0:31:00.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.33,0:31:03.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新型小鸟帽
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.10,0:31:08.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要戴上这个 我们就可以变成跟鸟人一样
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.88,0:31:11.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的是鸭子
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.81,0:31:13.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的是天鹅
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.45,0:31:19.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔…真是太神奇了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.62,0:31:20.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可以飞吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.89,0:31:21.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然可以喽
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.42,0:31:24.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的耶…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.33,0:31:26.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们就出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.39,0:31:28.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.16,0:31:29.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以帮忙带路吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.56,0:31:33.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我的雪鹅号又故障了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.63,0:31:34.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又坏掉啦
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.67,0:31:36.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我载你好了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.14,0:31:39.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 你可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.14,0:31:40.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们走喽
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.14,0:31:45.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈 这哪飞得起来嘛 我戴的是企鹅的帽子
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.68,0:31:49.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你放心 这次我已经换成白鸽帽了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.65,0:31:56.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们要对我们处什么刑啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.92,0:32:00.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,屁股打一千下
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.16,0:32:01.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.43,0:32:03.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快放我们出去
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.20,0:32:04.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别作梦了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.70,0:32:06.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔 你出将军
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.43,0:32:07.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我赢了…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.67,0:32:10.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沉底球
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.74,0:32:12.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们两个等一下会沉下去
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.47,0:32:14.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们趁机去拿钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.44,0:32:15.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.28,0:32:17.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.38,0:32:19.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 就差那么一步
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.95,0:32:21.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.22,0:32:26.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁现在 快呀
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.19,0:32:28.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 怎么搞的 胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.96,0:32:29.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 怎么搞的 小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.12,0:32:31.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔 我的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.66,0:32:33.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.49,0:32:35.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁现在还没人来 快逃呀
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.13,0:32:36.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 你不是…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.66,0:32:39.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 原来是你在搞鬼 给我记住
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.97,0:32:41.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遗忘草
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.70,0:32:43.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 让你们忘得一干二净
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.47,0:32:48.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们刚才在做什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.48,0:32:49.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.48,0:32:50.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家动作快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.98,0:32:53.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见…要保重喔…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.48,0:32:56.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我受够了 我要回家啦
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.98,0:32:59.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可能还要再多调查一下
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.49,0:33:01.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.22,0:33:03.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是我不好 害了大家
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.06,0:33:05.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.76,0:33:10.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难得能交上古斯基这个朋友 我们再多待一下嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.50,0:33:11.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来你叫古斯基啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.23,0:33:13.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.67,0:33:15.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我们两个也有责任
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.54,0:33:16.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么责任啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.74,0:33:19.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难得来到这里 我们就多开开眼界吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.17,0:33:23.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 你也给我们那种帽子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.24,0:33:24.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.78,0:33:25.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.68,0:33:31.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈 啄木鸟耶 太适合你了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.35,0:33:34.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的是…信天翁耶
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.02,0:33:37.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信天翁又怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.29,0:33:40.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了好了 别吵了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.56,0:33:43.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦 胖虎人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.03,0:33:47.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信天翁都要先助跑才行
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.87,0:33:52.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.27,0:33:54.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让你们久等啦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.82,0:34:04.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来事情是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.82,0:34:07.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是为什么 他们一听到我们是人类
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.49,0:34:09.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就对我们这么不友善啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.16,0:34:10.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.12,0:34:14.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滋古连度长官 非常憎恨人类的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.76,0:34:16.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,憎恨人类 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.50,0:34:19.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他曾经被枪打中
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.37,0:34:25.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟托邦有一支候鸟巡逻队
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.87,0:34:29.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的任务是监视世界的候鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.75,0:34:37.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,候鸟具有特别的能力 所以不会迷路找不到方向
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.55,0:34:41.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然其中也会有迷路的候鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.79,0:34:46.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将这些候鸟引导到正确的航道 或是保护他们的安全
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.19,0:34:49.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这都是候鸟巡逻队的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.03,0:34:56.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滋古连度就是在巡逻当中 被无情的人类用枪打中翅膀
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.14,0:34:57.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好过分喔
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.71,0:35:02.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从那个时候开始 他就变得相当憎恨人类
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.81,0:35:07.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本来地球上的鸟类 跟人类就是要和平共处
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.71,0:35:09.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在最重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.42,0:35:12.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家要想想 能为彼此做些什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.72,0:35:14.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是我们鸟人
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.52,0:35:16.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或你们人类都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.62,0:35:18.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士说的一点也没错
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.59,0:35:19.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.33,0:35:21.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你别在意
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.49,0:35:24.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我也知道 也有像你们这样的人类
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.20,0:35:27.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你们帮助古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.83,0:35:30.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪鹅号 是博士跟我一起做出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.14,0:35:31.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有啦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.01,0:35:34.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实几乎都是 古斯基一个人完成的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.01,0:35:37.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,考古学才是我的专长啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.14,0:35:40.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难怪这里全都是一些旧东西
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.65,0:35:43.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千万别碰那个东西
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.55,0:35:44.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 吓到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.15,0:35:48.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个非常古老的石碑 很容易就会碎掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.19,0:35:54.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这上面刻的传闻 或许会改变鸟托邦未来的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.66,0:35:59.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是去年 从鸟栖木的根挖掘出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.37,0:36:00.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟栖木？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.67,0:36:01.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.10,0:36:05.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.24,0:36:07.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.14,0:36:12.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它的顶端一直都有云笼罩着
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.71,0:36:14.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家把它叫做“烟环”
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.18,0:36:17.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到现在还没有人进去过呢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.49,0:36:29.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟栖木在我们鸟人诞生的时候 就一直持续的成长
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.70,0:36:34.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 它到底有多高 顶端上面有什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.73,0:36:36.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人知道
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.03,0:37:00.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里就是我家
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.56,0:37:04.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没回家不会挨骂呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.80,0:37:05.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会啦
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.83,0:37:08.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我是在练习飞行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.67,0:37:09.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快进来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.87,0:37:11.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.04,0:37:13.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底跑哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.37,0:37:16.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 你听我说啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.28,0:37:17.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫米露啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.21,0:37:20.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？是你的新朋友啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.28,0:37:24.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们好 我是住在隔壁的米露
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.75,0:37:26.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 我们是…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.25,0:37:29.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把古斯基带出去玩的 就是你们对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.39,0:37:30.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.39,0:37:32.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去练习开雪鹅号啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.86,0:37:35.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别找藉口了 也不跟我讲一声就跑出去
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.56,0:37:37.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她好像是古斯基的女朋友哟
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.80,0:37:38.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错没错
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.77,0:37:44.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 真是热闹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.60,0:37:47.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎古斯基的朋友来家里玩
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.41,0:37:49.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们就留下来吃晚饭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.68,0:37:51.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妈妈做的菜很好吃喔
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.95,0:37:55.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼 就知道撒娇 你要多多反省才对
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.92,0:37:57.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈 爸爸人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.95,0:38:01.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滋古连度长官 跟巴比伦队长现在刚好来家里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.69,0:38:04.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滋古连度长官在我们家啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.93,0:38:13.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你能在这份文件上签名
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.17,0:38:15.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.77,0:38:19.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是为了保护我们鸟托邦 跟地球上的鸟类
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.67,0:38:22.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不被人类迫害的 最终计划同意书
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.94,0:38:29.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在就剩下猫头鹰博士 还有你这位环境长官
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.82,0:38:32.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要签了名就能在议会通过
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.12,0:38:33.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很遗憾的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.22,0:38:36.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不赞成这个计划
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.82,0:38:39.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请您再考虑清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.79,0:38:42.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类确实是我们鸟类的劲敌
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.73,0:38:45.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但也不能因为这样 就草率决定
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.84,0:38:54.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好吃喔
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.37,0:38:56.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还是这么会吃
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.31,0:38:58.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好吃嘛 怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.18,0:38:59.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再来一碗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.78,0:39:00.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.65,0:39:01.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.78,0:39:02.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.22,0:39:06.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再来一碗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.02,0:39:08.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再来一碗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.05,0:39:09.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.73,0:39:13.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再来一碗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.39,0:39:14.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.06,0:39:16.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基也很厉害喔
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.53,0:39:18.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我要参加伊卡洛斯耐力赛
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.83,0:39:20.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不多增强一些体力的话 那怎么行
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.07,0:39:22.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么是伊卡洛斯耐力赛啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.07,0:39:26.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是候鸟巡逻队的入队测验
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.91,0:39:30.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是以传说中的鸟人 伊卡洛斯命名的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.78,0:39:36.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要加入巡逻队的话
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.38,0:39:40.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要通过技术速度 还有持久力的比赛来决定
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.89,0:39:44.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也会带着雪鹅号参加的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.39,0:39:46.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你才一直不断的练习
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.10,0:39:50.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会用翅膀飞的人
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.93,0:39:54.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有可能在 伊卡洛斯耐力赛中获胜吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.03,0:39:56.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这未免也太天真了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.44,0:40:00.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之你就多尽力练习吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.21,0:40:03.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.48,0:40:04.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米露
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.74,0:40:06.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基是有原因才飞不起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.91,0:40:08.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这也是没有办法的事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.61,0:40:09.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有原因？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.43,0:40:53.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为这样所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.03,0:40:57.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次当我想用自己的翅膀 飞看看的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.90,0:41:00.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就会想起 当初那种恐怖的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.67,0:41:01.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道那种感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.17,0:41:04.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自从我的耳朵被咬过一次之后
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.37,0:41:06.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到现在还很怕老鼠呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.47,0:41:10.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 没关系 我还有雪鹅号啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.58,0:41:11.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.54,0:41:14.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再怎么说你都是 靠自己的力量飞起来的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.65,0:41:16.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然有这个难得的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.38,0:41:18.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就一起去帮古斯基加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.95,0:41:19.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.12,0:41:21.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.35,0:41:23.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们也来参加比赛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.69,0:41:27.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听起来满有意思的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.19,0:41:28.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的要参加啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.69,0:41:29.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是当然的喽
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.00,0:41:32.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我决定要参加两卡洛斯耐力赛
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.70,0:41:34.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 是伊卡洛斯啦
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.13,0:41:37.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,管它一卡两卡还不都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.20,0:41:38.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差太多了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.94,0:41:43.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天就开始练习吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.44,0:41:45.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 今天晚上早一点睡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.08,0:41:47.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先等一下好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.65,0:41:48.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.95,0:41:51.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 厕所在哪里啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.62,0:41:53.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.99,0:41:56.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…下楼之后…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.99,0:41:59.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.73,0:42:03.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？我走错了吗…？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.23,0:42:07.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 那是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.70,0:42:11.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟蛋啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.35,0:42:26.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了…发生什么事了…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.35,0:42:27.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇…好可爱哟
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.55,0:42:28.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长得好像小夫喔
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.16,0:42:30.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 是个男孩子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.59,0:42:33.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是我的弟弟喽
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.26,0:42:37.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想怎么样嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.71,0:42:49.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.21,0:42:53.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓…尼…基…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.98,0:42:55.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果真如此…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.45,0:43:00.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基…太可怕了…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.05,0:43:02.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.26,0:43:07.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我听错了吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.10,0:43:13.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.63,0:43:15.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定没听错？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.17,0:43:16.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.17,0:43:21.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫头鹰博士边看着石碑 嘴里是这么说的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.91,0:43:25.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基的存在终于被证实了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.11,0:43:28.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.92,0:43:29.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基是指…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.22,0:43:34.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被封印在遥远古代 一股强势的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.59,0:43:38.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫头鹰博士 在我还尊他为师的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.69,0:43:42.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就已经投入毕生心血 从事腓尼基的研究
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.76,0:43:45.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说 要是我们 能得到这个力量的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.97,0:43:48.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是那个顽固的环境长官
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.83,0:43:50.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或是反对我们的人
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.60,0:43:52.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也都对我们束手无策
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.24,0:43:54.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.81,0:43:58.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那几个该处刑的人类也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.98,0:44:00.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 属下该死
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.08,0:44:04.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,负责看守的人 都不记得发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.79,0:44:09.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还求证到 有另外两个人类跟一只猫
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.66,0:44:14.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是让人类世界知道 我们的计划那就麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.36,0:44:16.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不快去把他们抓回来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.23,0:44:17.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.02,0:44:45.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些从人类世界带过来的鸟 在这里自由自在的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.66,0:44:47.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有受伤的鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.59,0:44:51.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就等它们的伤恢复之后 再让它们回去原来的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.57,0:44:55.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看那些企鹅好像是 电视上报导的失踪企鹅耶
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.04,0:44:57.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一点都没错耶
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.34,0:45:00.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是朱鹭耶 好漂亮喔
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.24,0:45:05.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让一些快要绝种的鸟类繁殖 再让它们回去人类的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.31,0:45:08.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我那个 身为环境长官的父亲的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.38,0:45:12.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小哔
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.22,0:45:16.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 你平安无事
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.72,0:45:17.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.26,0:45:20.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还以为它跑到哪里去了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.19,0:45:23.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要开始练习喽
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.23,0:45:26.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们听清楚喔
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.37,0:45:29.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那边那个中央厅 是伊卡洛耐力赛的起点
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.24,0:45:33.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,依照路标飞完一圈 然后折返
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.17,0:45:38.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之后在鸟栖木的烟环正下方 插上自己的羽毛
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.95,0:45:41.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这还不简单
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.25,0:45:42.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你就错了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.75,0:45:45.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,途中设置了许多障碍物
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.45,0:45:48.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总而言之速度是最基本的要求
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.45,0:45:51.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来比赛看谁先飞到 对面的山崖吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.86,0:45:54.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走喽
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.56,0:46:00.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走喽
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.73,0:46:02.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 出发喽
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.40,0:46:03.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.67,0:46:06.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 你可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.94,0:46:08.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉好棒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.57,0:46:09.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的感觉好棒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.31,0:46:15.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞的好快喔
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.69,0:46:24.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不会输呢 看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.80,0:46:34.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的有够快的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.30,0:46:38.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,速度不够快的 话根本无法获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.61,0:46:41.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我非参加不可吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.31,0:46:43.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看我还是算了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.84,0:46:44.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.68,0:46:48.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 我一定要拿到第一名
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.98,0:46:49.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.82,0:46:51.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么大家再飞个十趟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.82,0:46:53.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十趟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.58,0:47:23.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有信心 我相信 明天我一定会获胜的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.82,0:47:29.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.23,0:47:33.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.46,0:47:36.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们想要做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.46,0:47:38.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快住手
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.53,0:48:06.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位观众请注意
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.33,0:48:08.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟托邦最盛大的活动
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.33,0:48:12.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯耐力赛 的比赛时间即将到来
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.50,0:48:14.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在中央贵宾席上
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.07,0:48:19.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本大会委员长大老鹰总理 以及各级长官也都列席参加
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.04,0:48:23.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各个参赛者 已经都集合在起跑点上
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.21,0:48:26.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家加油
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.22,0:48:29.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.35,0:48:30.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会全力以赴的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.68,0:48:32.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫头鹰博士好像没有来耶
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.02,0:48:34.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他可能正在忙着他的研究吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.12,0:48:37.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.86,0:48:40.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.36,0:48:42.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也要出场比赛啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.13,0:48:46.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为用这个废物 就可以获胜吗
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.73,0:48:49.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是你能飞完全程的话 我服了你
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.14,0:48:50.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们两个…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.54,0:48:52.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是男子汉的话 别只靠那张嘴巴
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.74,0:48:54.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家拿出实力来比个高下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.58,0:48:55.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.74,0:48:58.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米露 你也要出场比赛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.65,0:48:59.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这还用问吗
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.95,0:49:02.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是负责照顾古斯基的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.38,0:49:03.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.59,0:49:06.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.59,0:49:08.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们等着瞧好了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.09,0:49:08.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米露
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.29,0:49:10.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让各位久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.62,0:49:13.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在请大老鹰总理 来为大家说几句话
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.90,0:49:26.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在将开始举行伊卡洛斯 候鸟巡逻队的入队测验
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.38,0:49:36.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,测验结果的判定 由巴比伦队长全权负责
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.02,0:49:45.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了选手以外 其他人请退出比赛场外
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.96,0:49:47.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家加油喔
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.47,0:49:56.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,个位选手 请就定位
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.31,0:50:02.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,预备…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.94,0:50:05.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.16,0:50:22.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各个选手几乎同时起飞
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.93,0:50:26.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底谁是第一个飞回来的呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.70,0:50:30.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后在鸟栖木上 插上羽毛的人又会是谁呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.22,0:50:43.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是那里
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.78,0:51:13.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唉 我已经失去资格了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.56,0:51:23.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个顽固的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.39,0:51:25.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是不可能获胜的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.13,0:51:30.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害喔
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.20,0:51:35.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.21,0:51:43.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好险哪
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.71,0:51:48.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.35,0:51:49.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.22,0:52:57.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米露
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.99,0:52:58.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.99,0:53:00.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们先走
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.37,0:53:20.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米露 这里很危险 赶快离开
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.68,0:53:30.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经看不到古斯基他们了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.45,0:53:32.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米露 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.89,0:53:38.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我翅膀被刚才的蜘蛛丝缠到 变得不好飞了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.13,0:53:39.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们先走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.53,0:53:42.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.83,0:53:46.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的希望都寄托在你身上了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.41,0:54:01.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一组领先的选手已经回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.42,0:54:05.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接着就是要 一股作气的冲上鸟栖木
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.81,0:54:25.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.26,0:54:49.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太奸诈了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.40,0:54:51.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然用这种道具想要轻松过关
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.48,0:55:11.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.92,0:55:14.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我绝不会认输的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.42,0:55:51.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同时到达
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.42,0:55:54.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,优胜者是 燕太郎选手跟古斯基选手
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.93,0:55:58.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,优胜者是 燕太郎选手跟古斯基选手
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.47,0:55:59.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.70,0:56:02.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能够优胜实在是太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.87,0:56:05.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 古斯基这孩子…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.07,0:56:07.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.02,0:56:22.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们用最热烈的掌声 恭喜燕太郎选手跟古斯基选手
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.36,0:56:26.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并且也给参赛选手 一些鼓励的掌声
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.86,0:56:31.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.83,0:56:34.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎跟小夫也尽力了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.87,0:56:36.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我比大雄厉害吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.00,0:56:39.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是一样 大雄太差劲了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.54,0:56:40.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.18,0:56:47.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才的比赛结果有更动
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.12,0:56:51.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在请巴比伦队长为大家发表
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.92,0:56:53.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如同各位看到的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.55,0:56:56.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基选手在这次比赛中 的确表现相当出色
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.36,0:56:59.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是他的飞行 并不是靠自己的翅膀
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.49,0:57:02.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是靠其他道具来完成的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.76,0:57:07.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这种情况下我们可以认定 他是真正的优胜者吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.43,0:57:11.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了不让伟大的伊卡洛斯 的名誉受到屈辱
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.50,0:57:14.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们宣布古斯基选手失去这个资格
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.78,0:57:18.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,优胜者就燕太郎选手一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.65,0:57:22.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪有这种事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.82,0:57:23.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太过分了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.72,0:57:25.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有搞错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.59,0:57:26.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另外
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.82,0:57:29.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凡是靠自己的翅膀 飞完全程的选手
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.46,0:57:32.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部都有资格加入巡逻队的行列
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.39,0:57:34.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,报告完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.17,0:57:41.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靠自己的翅膀…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.22,0:58:01.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.06,0:58:03.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请原谅我下属的无礼
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.56,0:58:09.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多亏你多年的研究 让腓尼基的力量成为我的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.46,0:58:14.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么一来所有的一切 都会照我的预定完成
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.70,0:58:15.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恨的人类啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.77,0:58:17.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们就等着瞧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.20,0:58:20.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我复仇的时机来了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.88,0:58:23.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴比伦
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.71,0:58:26.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天一早立刻出动巡逻队
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.85,0:58:28.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.47,0:58:50.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后我还是要 靠自己的翅膀飞起来才行哪
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.64,0:58:53.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 你能不能想想办法？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.51,0:58:54.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这的确是有点难啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.01,0:58:57.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.11,0:58:59.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们明天就要出动了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.01,0:59:00.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要再说啦
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.38,0:59:04.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们也稍微体谅一下 古斯基的心情好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.03,0:59:22.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 把自己关在房间里
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.70,0:59:25.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是让他静一静吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.54,0:59:28.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我总觉得古斯基 这次被宣布失去资格的背后
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.14,0:59:30.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像有什么隐情喔
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.15,0:59:33.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有这种感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.65,0:59:41.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 静香
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.46,0:59:44.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.07,0:59:56.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从现在开始
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.54,1:00:00.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这支新的候鸟巡逻队 即将执行首次的任务
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.67,1:00:03.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管在什么情况下
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.54,1:00:04.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对要服从命令
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.38,1:00:06.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道吗
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.61,1:00:07.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.95,1:00:10.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都是被挑选出来勇者
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.35,1:00:14.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在首次任务中 要尽情发挥你们的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.55,1:00:17.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,候鸟巡逻队 出动
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.48,1:00:36.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到古斯基了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.84,1:00:37.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有耶
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.84,1:00:39.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都没有人看到他
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.51,1:00:41.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他到底跑哪去了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.35,1:00:44.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去猫头鹰博士家找过了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.35,1:00:44.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对喔
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.92,1:00:45.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.65,1:00:46.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.35,1:00:48.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫头鹰博士也不在耶
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.89,1:00:49.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 怎么会…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.86,1:00:52.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.73,1:00:55.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这根羽毛是警备队的…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.60,1:00:59.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是博士很很重视的石碑碎片
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.90,1:01:02.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士一定是在滋古连度长官那里
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.60,1:01:04.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这件事情 果然是有问题
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.24,1:01:07.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要先找到古斯基才行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.27,1:01:42.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.68,1:01:46.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.98,1:01:50.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你们不要管我
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.92,1:01:52.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想自己试试看
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.82,1:01:56.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎么样 我一定要靠自己的翅膀飞起来
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.36,1:01:57.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.36,1:01:58.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士被抓走了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.99,1:02:00.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.96,1:02:02.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是你的好朋友不是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.06,1:02:06.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家同心协力的话 一定可以把他救出来的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.70,1:02:07.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.87,1:02:08.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.60,1:02:10.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时你还满会讲话的嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.94,1:02:11.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.01,1:02:14.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 你有没有什么线索呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.21,1:02:17.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许石碑上的文字 已经解读出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.51,1:02:20.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时光包袱
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.21,1:02:23.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个可以让 毁掉的石碑再恢复原状
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.22,1:02:26.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是能知道上写什么就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.75,1:02:28.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就用翻译蒟蒻啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.19,1:02:30.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对喔
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.32,1:02:33.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么会把这个法宝给忘了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.13,1:02:36.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翻译蒟蒻
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.96,1:02:38.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…我知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.53,1:02:40.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上面写什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.60,1:02:44.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基耸立于北方尽头
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.54,1:02:46.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拉拉亚多山的龙之谷底下
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.47,1:02:49.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,龙之谷？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.28,1:02:54.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基的力量 好比神的强大力量
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.75,1:02:58.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假使唤醒腓尼基的力量的话…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.02,1:03:00.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到这里就没了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.12,1:03:03.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基的力量 指的到底是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.89,1:03:04.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.36,1:03:07.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 这么一来全都明白了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.86,1:03:10.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滋古连度想要利用 腓尼基的强大力量
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.06,1:03:14.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,企图将鸟托邦占为己有
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.67,1:03:15.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.64,1:03:17.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去告诉伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.00,1:03:21.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯一定会知道 腓尼基的力量是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.51,1:03:24.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯不是传说中的鸟人吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.41,1:03:25.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是古代的人吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.08,1:03:29.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听猫头鹰博士说过…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.32,1:03:31.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他人在监狱岛
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.16,1:03:38.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯为了负起
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.89,1:03:43.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滋古连度在候鸟巡逻队时 遭人类枪击的责任
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.26,1:03:45.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自愿被关进监狱岛
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.04,1:04:23.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.37,1:04:26.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.24,1:04:27.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是伊卡洛斯吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.54,1:04:31.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯 请你帮助我们
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.05,1:04:34.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫头鹰博士被滋古连度抓走了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.48,1:04:38.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去年被挖掘出来的石碑上写说
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.82,1:04:41.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基被封印在龙之谷
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.06,1:04:45.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滋古连度知道之后…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.53,1:04:49.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯 请助我们一臂之力
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.03,1:04:51.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.56,1:04:53.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再这样下去鸟托邦就会…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.21,1:05:09.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们快让
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.63,1:05:27.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们几个 赶快过 来抓紧我
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.61,1:05:41.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害喔
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.48,1:05:43.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是传说中的羽翼
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.86,1:05:53.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欧蒂雅 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.86,1:06:00.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定要称下去 加油啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.14,1:06:05.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯 小宝宝…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.64,1:06:06.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危险
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.85,1:06:15.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是天空耶
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.26,1:06:22.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.19,1:06:26.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在要一口气 飞到拉拉亚多山
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.36,1:06:27.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们抓紧喔
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.81,1:06:39.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们终于到了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.17,1:06:43.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基的力量就是 被封印在这个龙之谷下面
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.18,1:06:46.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要让这股力量重新复活
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.91,1:06:51.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后把人类世界的鸟类 全都移居到这鸟托邦来
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.22,1:06:55.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从持续破坏环境的人类手中 把我们的同伴救出来
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.96,1:06:58.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对不行
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.93,1:06:59.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫头鹰博士？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.19,1:07:01.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是这么做的话
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.69,1:07:04.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类世界的生态 就会变得很诡异
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.73,1:07:07.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟本来就应该跟人类一起生活
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.20,1:07:08.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.97,1:07:11.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把你带来这里 并不是要听你大谈阔论的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.41,1:07:14.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我这个 曾经跟你一起研究的人
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.97,1:07:17.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,分享研究成果也是应该的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.71,1:07:19.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要早点觉醒啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.45,1:07:19.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.08,1:07:20.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.71,1:07:23.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶 快放开博士
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.35,1:07:26.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把这三个人关起来
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.72,1:07:30.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他人立刻把这个山谷的雪铲除
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.59,1:07:33.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.76,1:07:35.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.86,1:07:37.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好冷喔
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.73,1:07:40.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.97,1:07:42.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们先降落一下好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.18,1:07:56.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是山谷的另一边
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.68,1:07:58.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么法宝快拿出来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.75,1:08:00.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应变灯
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.72,1:08:01.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个灯是…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.95,1:08:03.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了啦 不用说明
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.29,1:08:04.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快一点
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.36,1:08:07.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 不冷了耶
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.46,1:08:08.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不可思议耶
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.59,1:08:11.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香跟我还有伊卡洛斯 也一起来
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.23,1:08:11.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.20,1:08:14.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯也会冷吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.47,1:08:15.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.97,1:08:16.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.24,1:08:21.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧 大雄？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.51,1:08:24.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好没什么大碍
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.71,1:08:26.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 这是什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.71,1:08:28.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好奇怪喔
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.75,1:08:33.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是人类耶
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.02,1:08:35.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是立体影像
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.32,1:08:40.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的名字叫鸟野守 是二十二世纪的鸟类学者
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.29,1:08:42.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二十二世纪？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.26,1:08:46.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讨厌人类的我非常喜欢鸟
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.00,1:08:51.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我原本想跟小鸟们坐时光机
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.30,1:08:56.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到哺乳类 还没诞生的远古时代一起生活
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.09,1:09:12.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.09,1:09:18.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为时空乱流 时光机撞上了超空间的墙壁
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.53,1:09:20.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才会来到多元宇宙
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.67,1:09:27.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔 我知道了 原来这里是别的星球
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.61,1:09:31.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然很意外 不过这也是大好机会
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.94,1:09:35.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里的话 不必担心会改变人类历史
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.35,1:09:40.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时年轻的我 如同被恶魔附了身一样…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.05,1:09:44.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了在这里建造一个鸟托邦
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.09,1:09:48.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是我任意将各种鸟类进化
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.60,1:09:58.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之后我教导鸟人 所有我所知道的知识
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.14,1:10:00.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说的话
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.34,1:10:04.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基的祖先 是鸟野博士创造出来的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.88,1:10:06.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动作快 不行休息
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.01,1:10:10.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要把这个山谷的雪全都铲平
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.32,1:10:12.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基的力量是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.65,1:10:13.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.09,1:10:16.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说什么话 还不快做事
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.89,1:10:23.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是鸟托邦也有鸟类的天敌
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.14,1:10:35.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最后的工作 就是要想办法把它解决掉
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.91,1:10:39.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是我把它引诱到 这个北端的山谷来
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.75,1:10:40.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始爆破
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.63,1:10:58.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我让它沉睡在这个冰山下
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.56,1:11:01.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经完成了我的工作
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.43,1:11:03.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟托邦的孩子们记住
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.77,1:11:06.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千万不可以把腓尼基唤醒过来…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.67,1:11:11.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听起来腓尼基 好像是一头巨大的猛兽
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.81,1:11:13.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们快赶过去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.65,1:11:16.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来它就是腓尼基的力量…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.15,1:11:23.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官 要唤醒它吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.06,1:11:27.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 我怎么会没想到呢
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.46,1:11:29.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以由我来控制它
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.46,1:11:34.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后再把它 从鸟托邦送到人类的世界去
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.98,1:11:46.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.25,1:11:49.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我让你再度苏醒过来的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.02,1:11:53.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 你要听从我的指示
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.99,1:11:55.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个大坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.09,1:11:56.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.50,1:12:05.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基 给我安静下来
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.53,1:12:06.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.27,1:12:10.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,传说中的英雄
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.94,1:12:11.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.27,1:12:15.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.71,1:12:16.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.94,1:12:18.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.21,1:12:19.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好朋友你来了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.55,1:12:20.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.75,1:12:22.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.02,1:12:24.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快抓住伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.52,1:12:26.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是干什么
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.15,1:12:29.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吱古连度想要控制腓尼基
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.99,1:12:32.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,企图征服人类世界呢
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.86,1:12:34.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会让他得逞的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.29,1:12:36.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是这个… 找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.26,1:12:39.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进化退化放射线源
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.37,1:12:41.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把开关调到退化
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.77,1:12:45.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要让你退化成变形虫
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.64,1:12:46.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你别管闲事
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.54,1:12:48.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.25,1:12:54.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.75,1:12:56.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,转到进化去了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.25,1:13:03.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基又急速成长了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.26,1:13:07.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基 你要听从我的命令
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.34,1:13:22.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.41,1:13:26.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.09,1:13:37.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.62,1:13:38.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴比伦
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.52,1:13:40.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你照顾一下滋古连度
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.09,1:13:42.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.37,1:13:52.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基要去哪里啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.61,1:13:54.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.61,1:13:58.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,归属的本能 让它朝鸟托邦的方向去了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.38,1:13:59.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟托邦有危险了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.11,1:14:04.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家把力量结合起来 一起守护鸟托邦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.65,1:14:07.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 我们也一起加入
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.95,1:14:08.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.05,1:14:10.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.66,1:14:12.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.56,1:14:13.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.34,1:14:32.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家不要慌乱 快到山崖上避难
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.48,1:14:36.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会有这么可怕的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.52,1:14:39.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能够战斗的人快拿起武器来
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.75,1:14:40.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.39,1:14:43.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,候鸟巡逻队马上赶来
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.09,1:14:50.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始攻击
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.42,1:15:11.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战况好激烈喔
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.78,1:15:13.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 快拿武器来
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.69,1:15:16.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说是武器 其实就是我们惯用的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.32,1:15:18.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,空气炮跟休克枪
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.12,1:15:22.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之先把腓尼基 赶出鸟托邦再说
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.70,1:15:23.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.93,1:15:25.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,防身斗篷
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.93,1:15:30.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香 你们用这个 带小朋友们去避难
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.80,1:15:31.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.24,1:15:33.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家听好
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.41,1:15:34.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千万要小心
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.65,1:15:45.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没用 它根本不痛不痒
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.42,1:15:47.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我来
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.66,1:15:51.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.26,1:15:52.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还有缩小电筒呢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.09,1:15:55.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就用这个把你缩到最小
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.06,1:15:59.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,防身斗篷
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.33,1:16:00.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.73,1:16:01.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有小河
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.27,1:16:03.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.74,1:16:06.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个地方应该就安全了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.74,1:16:07.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.57,1:16:10.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我的小哔
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.51,1:16:12.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米露 你们在这里等我一下
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.78,1:16:13.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要去哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.02,1:16:20.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再这样继续下去也治不了它
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.52,1:16:25.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基 你觉悟吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.96,1:16:29.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.86,1:16:31.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.23,1:16:34.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.11,1:16:43.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯 你还好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.98,1:16:45.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你帮了我
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.54,1:16:46.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.71,1:16:47.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米露
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.81,1:16:48.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.31,1:16:50.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.92,1:16:52.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心 我没事
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.29,1:16:55.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米露 静香人呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.99,1:17:03.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小哔…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.00,1:17:06.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小哔…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.50,1:17:08.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 小哔
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.30,1:17:12.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基根本就不怕休克枪
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.14,1:17:13.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,空气炮也一样
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.77,1:17:15.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有更厉害的武器吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.51,1:17:17.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.24,1:17:20.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.55,1:17:26.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟野博士当初坐来的时光机 或许会有什么武器也说不定喔
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.15,1:17:30.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们把腓尼基引诱出来 然后把它解决掉
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.09,1:17:31.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不愧是哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.76,1:17:34.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那台时光机在哪里呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.66,1:17:36.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 对喔
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.46,1:17:38.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有一个线索
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.10,1:17:42.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在鸟栖木的最顶端
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.60,1:17:46.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我曾经穿过云层地带 很仔细的看过
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.84,1:17:48.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看过时光机
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.77,1:17:49.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很有可能
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.61,1:17:52.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去引诱腓尼基
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.61,1:17:54.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.11,1:17:57.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯 你的翅膀…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.88,1:18:01.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯你要撑着点啊
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.95,1:18:02.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.06,1:18:05.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他大打算去引诱腓尼基
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.79,1:18:10.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.97,1:18:22.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 腓尼基
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.37,1:18:24.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你尽量来追我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.48,1:18:30.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基已经朝鸟栖木飞去了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.08,1:18:32.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危险 古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.65,1:18:33.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们快走
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.61,1:18:57.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是云层地带
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.18,1:19:06.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.96,1:19:14.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.13,1:19:23.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.90,1:19:25.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.71,1:19:28.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道他们怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.91,1:19:31.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基一定做得到的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.78,1:19:33.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿出你的勇气来
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.88,1:19:35.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞起来
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.48,1:19:36.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定可以的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.08,1:19:39.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.19,1:19:44.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.82,1:19:46.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你飞起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.43,1:19:48.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.46,1:19:49.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你飞起来了耶
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.90,1:19:56.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它来了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.20,1:19:57.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄就拜托你们了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.10,1:19:57.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.97,1:19:59.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 腓尼基
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.48,1:20:06.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有种就就跟我来
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.69,1:20:22.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 我们要赶快找到时光机
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.13,1:20:24.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像这个时候要用…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.53,1:20:27.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 就用声音凝固剂
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.50,1:20:29.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可行喔
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.77,1:20:31.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,声音凝固剂
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.87,1:20:35.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 你快喝下去 然后大声叫
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.01,1:20:36.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 看我的
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.29,1:20:53.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.29,1:20:56.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你在哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.56,1:20:58.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.56,1:21:00.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 还好吧？ 大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.43,1:21:02.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.43,1:21:03.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.80,1:21:07.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到 鸟栖木的顶端 是个湖泊耶
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.37,1:21:11.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些水一定是积了好几万年吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.81,1:21:13.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 你看
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.21,1:21:17.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是鸟野博士的时光机啊
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.18,1:21:19.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 我们快走
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.72,1:21:23.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道大雄他们有没有来
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.76,1:21:24.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 快一点
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.76,1:21:28.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是机舱
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.33,1:21:32.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望电源没有故障才好
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.83,1:21:34.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都已经荒废二亿年了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.53,1:21:39.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道还可不可以用
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.81,1:21:41.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该有设置什么武器才对
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.64,1:21:43.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会不会是这个
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.05,1:21:49.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,休克炮 准备发射
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.78,1:21:50.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.68,1:21:52.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个东西一定可以打倒腓尼基
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.05,1:21:54.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 快去通知古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.99,1:21:55.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.65,1:21:57.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的白鸽帽借我一下
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.46,1:22:02.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.23,1:22:05.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.40,1:22:07.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 一切都准备就绪了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.27,1:22:11.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听到我的暗号之后 就要急速上升喔
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.27,1:22:12.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.57,1:22:14.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 就是这样
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.78,1:22:17.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.51,1:22:22.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是现在
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.62,1:22:30.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.62,1:22:31.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.46,1:22:32.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.50,1:22:41.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.77,1:22:45.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.37,1:22:50.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 我们成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.71,1:22:51.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.91,1:22:53.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 你表现得太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.28,1:22:55.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我用自己的翅膀飞起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.52,1:22:58.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么一来腓尼基就…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.05,1:23:03.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.42,1:23:06.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道是…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.90,1:23:11.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,休克枪根本就没有效
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.93,1:23:13.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真讨厌 还不快给我消失
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.43,1:23:15.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.94,1:23:20.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就让时光机把它带走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.67,1:23:23.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,计时器调到零
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.38,1:23:24.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就可以了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.94,1:23:26.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时光机开始启动
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.88,1:23:28.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们快离开
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.68,1:23:32.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.93,1:23:41.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.06,1:23:44.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次是真的成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.66,1:23:45.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它到哪里去了？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.36,1:23:49.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是在 地球还没形成前的宇宙中吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.91,1:23:59.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去告诉大家吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.68,1:24:01.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.41,1:24:03.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还要把鸟托邦的大火消灭呢
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.98,1:24:05.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？要怎么做呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.72,1:24:07.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩西的手杖
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.02,1:24:10.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先设定好研钵型
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.69,1:24:11.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.72,1:24:38.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.89,1:24:42.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.22,1:24:43.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.86,1:24:45.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基已经被消灭了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.76,1:24:46.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.03,1:24:47.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.13,1:24:55.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下雨了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.17,1:24:57.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样大火就会灭了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.97,1:24:59.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟托邦得救了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.11,1:25:01.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.41,1:25:02.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米露
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.04,1:25:04.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 这里
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.28,1:25:05.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.61,1:25:07.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基已经不见了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.78,1:25:08.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.05,1:25:11.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 你自己能飞了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.05,1:25:12.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.45,1:25:16.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个时候不知道为什么 好像听到伊卡洛斯的声音
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.59,1:25:19.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说“拿出勇气来”
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.50,1:25:30.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就好像伊卡洛斯 附身到古斯基身上呢
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.30,1:25:31.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.10,1:25:34.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你是人类啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.11,1:25:37.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.11,1:25:39.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.21,1:25:40.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.18,1:25:42.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是呢
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.21,1:25:43.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 我们没有告诉你
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.02,1:25:44.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.72,1:25:47.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都已经知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.69,1:25:48.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.89,1:25:50.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.92,1:25:52.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在等你们回去呢
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.09,1:25:55.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基往鸟栖木的顶端 去了之后就…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.49,1:25:56.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是人类耶
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.83,1:26:00.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些人是拯救鸟托邦的恩人
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.60,1:26:03.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类救了鸟托邦？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.50,1:26:06.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.14,1:26:07.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.91,1:26:09.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这没什么啦
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.67,1:26:11.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实不只是我们
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.94,1:26:16.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这都是靠古斯基还有大家 一起努力才能成功的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.47,1:26:35.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重建工作也很辛苦喔
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.63,1:26:38.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要大家同心协力 一定没问题的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.37,1:26:41.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小哔
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.57,1:26:47.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从今以后人类跟鸟类 也要相互扶持生活下去
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.85,1:26:52.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类也不能依赖鸟托邦 要努力加油才行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.90,1:27:10.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明年你就可以用自己的翅膀 参加伊卡洛斯耐力赛了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.07,1:27:12.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.60,1:27:15.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且我还要成为一名 英勇的候鸟巡逻队员
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.11,1:27:18.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来优胜也是非你莫属喔
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.68,1:27:20.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很感谢你们大家
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.91,1:27:22.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我绝对不会忘记你们的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.21,1:27:26.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就让我们候鸟巡逻队 送你们去候鸟航线吧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.99,1:27:27.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.25,1:27:29.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？小夫他人呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.19,1:27:30.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.69,1:27:33.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没办法带你回去
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.26,1:27:39.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要赶快长大 然后加入巡逻队喔
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.33,1:27:41.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等到那个时候我会再来看你喔
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.93,1:27:44.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 我们回家吧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.77,1:27:47.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了 古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.14,1:27:49.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 再见
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.31,1:27:57.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定会再来看你的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.92,1:27:59.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.65,1:28:01.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟托邦
